majoris-stickies (0.7.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add safe Unicode RTF export for active notes without changing schema v5.
  * Record reminder submission before marking one-shot reminders as notified.
  * Expand Debian release CI with a bounded GTK smoke test and binary build.
  * Keep Majoris Image and GNOME Shell integration optional.

